{"id":"n49964-2-7","stage":3,"title":"들키다 · 暴露","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49964-2-7-1","ko":"어머니께 거짓말을 들켜서 혼이 났어.","zh":"我因为对妈妈说谎被发现了，被训了一顿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니께","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"2","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니께","audio":"/audio/fe71479b1da8481889c7.mp3"}},{"text":"거짓말을","meaning":"谎言","explanation":"거짓말：谎言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"거짓말","audio":"/audio/a142bcee838500ead54b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28444","senseId":"1","lemma":"거짓말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거짓말을","audio":"/audio/d3ba155f5ff828e91261.mp3"}},{"text":"들켜서","meaning":"暴露，察觉","explanation":"들키다：暴露，察觉；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"들키다","audio":"/audio/5bef0f014fc6afa44cfb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49964","senseId":"2","lemma":"들키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들켜서","audio":"/audio/8bc088b08703b6092842.mp3"}},{"text":"혼이","meaning":"灵魂，魂魄","explanation":"혼：灵魂，魂魄；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"혼","audio":"/audio/42d5d8f8594d286d44c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87964","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼이","audio":"/audio/9c60b118bed8f2e8c076.mp3"}},{"text":"났어.","meaning":"挨骂","explanation":"나다：挨骂；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"31","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"났어","audio":"/audio/a44d1f8862eee3132ce7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用